whisperme for Debian
--------------------

Quick Start
-----------

1. Reload systemd user daemon:

   systemctl --user daemon-reload

2. Start the whisperme daemon:

   systemctl --user start whispermed.service

3. (Optional) Enable auto-start on login:

   systemctl --user enable whispermed.service

4. Configure a hotkey to trigger recording. Example for sxhkd:

   cp /usr/share/doc/whisperme/examples/sxhkdrc ~/.config/sxhkd/sxhkdrc
   pkill -USR1 sxhkd

5. Press your hotkey and speak. Text is typed into the focused window.

See /usr/share/doc/whisperme/ for full documentation.

 -- Anders Fugmann <anders@fugmann.net>
